msgid "Shows a scrolling bar that displays headlines at the bottom."
msgstr "Показує рухому панель із заголовками внизу."

msgctxt "Settings.Feeds"
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Сховище"

msgctxt "Settings.Feeds"
msgid "Strict parsing rejects malformed feeds and RDF/RSS 1.0. Lenient parsing recovers usable titles, links, dates, and summaries whenever they can still be identified."
